doc Acme's packages: text banners and bar charts for the terminal.
  A small private truck, hosted by `server.pkg` rather than the universal
  registry. Programs reach it through a package tree:

  ```
  // pkg_tree.pkg
  tree
    acme  http://localhost:6464
  ```

  | package | provides |
  |---|---|
  | `acme/banner` | `banner(s)`: text in a box |
  | `acme/bars` | `bars_row(label, n, max, width)`: one row of a bar chart |

truck
  banner
  bars
